-- title:
--   Reverse eigenspace comparison for a surjective model (D,π,φ_D)
-- statement:
--   Let $k$ be a field and $G$ a group, and let $M$ be a representation of $G$ over $k$ which is finite-dimensional as a $k$-vector space. Let $U,W\le G$ be normal subgroups of finite index such that $\rho_M(u)=1$ for all $u\in U$, and let $q$ be a prime that is invertible in $k$ (i.e. $q\neq 0$ in $k$) such that every $w\in W$ satisfies $w^{q^{a}}\in U$ for some $a\in\mathbb{N}$. Let $t,\varphi\in G$ be such that, in $G/W$, the element $\bar\varphi\,\bar t\,\bar\varphi^{-1}$ lies in the subgroup generated by $\bar t$ (its integral powers). Let $D$ be a finite-dimensional $k$-vector space and $\pi\colon M\to D$ a $k$-linear map with: $\ker\pi\subseteq\big(\sum_{w\in W}\operatorname{im}(\rho_M(w)-1)\big)+\operatorname{im}(\rho_M(t)-1)$; $\operatorname{im}(\rho_M(t)-1)\subseteq\ker\pi$; $\pi$ surjective; and $\sum_{w\in W}\operatorname{im}(\rho_M(w)-1)\subseteq\ker\pi$. Let $\varphi_D\colon D\to D$ be $k$-linear with $\varphi_D\circ\pi=\pi\circ\rho_M(\varphi)$, and let $m\in\mathbb{N}$, $b\in k$ with $mb=1$ in $k$. Then $\dim_k\ker(\varphi_D-b\cdot\mathrm{id})\le\dim_k\ker(mF-1)$, where $F$ is the endomorphism of the quotient $M^W/\operatorname{im}(\rho_{M^W}(\bar t)-1)$ induced by the action of $\bar\varphi$ on the $G/W$-representation $M^W$ (`frobeniusOnCoinvariants` applied to `M.quotientToInvariants W`, $\bar t$, $\bar\varphi$).
--
--   This is the inequality opposite to the one comparing the model eigenspace with the $\bar t$-coinvariants of $M^W$: with $\pi$ surjective and killing the $W$-augmentation, the natural map from $(M^W)_{\bar t}$ to $D$ is an isomorphism intertwining $F$ with $\varphi_D$. It feeds the lower bound in the local Euler-characteristic computation at a prime different from the residue characteristic, and is used in [`groupCohomology.finrank_invariants_add_finrank_invariants_dualTwist_le_finrank_inflationImage`](thm.html#groupCohomology.finrank_invariants_add_finrank_invariants_dualTwist_le_finrank_inflationImage).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_groupCohomology_finrank_ker_le_finrank_ker_frobeniusOnCoinvariants_of_model.lean

import Mathlib
